        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin M516, Single Point Mortise Soho Handleset With 54854V Soho Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern look of Baldwin's Soho Handleset is exemplified in the sleek, skinny grip. The slightly rounded ends of the plates add to the overall contemporary flow of the entrance handle. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the M516 Soho Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and 003 PVD Polished Brass Finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Estates Collection Soho Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 54854V Soho Lever</li>\r\n<li>Outside Grip Plate Length: 17.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Grip Plate Width: 2.77\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Grip Length: 8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Projection of Outside Grip: 2.53\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Lock Plate Length: 10.37\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Lock Plate Width: 2.77\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Plate Length: 2.10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Plate Width: 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Length: 10.37\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Width: 2.77\"</li> \r\n<li>Lever Projection (interior): 2.48\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Soho Single Point Lock Mortise Handleset, Baldwin M516",
                "description": "Baldwin M516, Single Point Mortise Soho Handleset - The modern look of Baldwin's Two-Point Locking Handleset is exemplified in the sleek, skinny grip. The slightly rounded ends of the plates add to the overall contemporary flow of the entrance handle. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
